        "Wikipedia",
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Williamsfield%2C_Illinois"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The village was laid out in 1888 and a post office opened the same year.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Williamsfield%2C_Illinois"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Williamsfield sits in eastern Knox County, about 21 miles east of Galesburg, the county seat.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
