        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Williamsfield%2C_Illinois"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Illinois Route 180 runs through the east side of the village, connecting it to Galva and U.S. Route 24.",
